            RotoRem repairs dryers in homes in Sofia and settlements around the city. We serve various areas of the capital, including Mladost, Lyulin, Druzhba, Lozenets, Ovcha Kupel, Krasno Selo, Borovo, Manastirski Livadi, Nadezhda, Studentski Grad and other parts of Sofia.
          </p>
          <p>
            The dryer does not need to be transported to a physical repair shop. A technician visits the specified address.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section class={sectionClass} id="faq">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Frequently asked questions</h2>
          <div class={`w-20 h-1 ${accentBar} mx-auto`}></div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
          {faqs.map((faq) => (
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-50 to-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
              <details class="group">
                <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-5 cursor-pointer">
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 pr-4">{faq.q}</h3>
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </summary>
                <div class="p-5 pt-0 text-gray-800 border-t border-gray-100">
                  <p class="leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
                </div>
              </details>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <div class="container max-w-5xl mb-28">
    <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-600 to-purple-800 text-white p-12 md:p-14 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Dryer problem?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mb-4 text-white/90 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        If the dryer does not heat up, does not dry well, the drum does not rotate, the machine stops during operation, makes an unusual noise or shows an error, contact RotoRem for diagnostics and repairs at an address in Sofia.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg mb-2 text-white/90">On-site diagnostics: {diagnosticPrice}</p>
      <p class="text-lg mb-8">Telephone: <a href="tel:0898340982" class="font-semibold text-white hover:underline">089 834 0982</a></p>
      <a href="tel:0898340982" class="inline-block bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
